It looks like you have these values stored in a vector separate from the data.frame "fit_8_1", but perhaps you used attach(). Is "order_mts" the name of a column in fit_8_1?

> 1. I can't find anything that explains this error, so can anyone tell me what it could mean?

Does it still occur in the latest development version of the software?

install.packages("lavaan", repos="http://www.da.ugent.be", type="source")

> 2. what does it mean, if I'd fix a value to the thresholds and how can I calculate them, as many posts would worte smth like order_mts | 1.3*t1 + 3.7*ts, which I don't understand

In your example above, the first threshold is fixed to 1.3, and the second threshold is fixed to 3.7.  In your model syntax, you do not fix the thresholds, so they will be freely estimated by default.  You can do whatever makes sense.

