> 1: In lav_data_full(data = data, group = group, cluster = cluster,  :
>   lavaan WARNING: some observed variances are (at least) a factor 1000 times larger than others; use varTable(fit) to investigate
> Some of my variables are the same across many samples (eg. Age) while others are not (eg. Pollen) so this makes sense to me.
> Once I get this model sorted I have simpler models to look at local level effects and to account for any potential problems from pseudo-replication.
