> Error: p == round(p, 0) is not TRUE

The getCov() function is designed to construct a symmetric matrix when you only have the lower-diagonal or upper-diagonal information.  You have all the values, so you just need to put them into a 5x5 matrix.

matrix(l1, nrow = 5, ncol = 5,
       dimnames = list(c("deference","laboract","unionsen","years","age"),

                       c("deference","laboract","unionsen","years","age"))

