Hi,

Your model is saturated (degrees of freedom = 0), which means that it cannot be tested. Model testing requires that you have a surplus of information, and the consistency of that surplus information with the estimated model provides a way of testing model fit.

https://www.researchgate.net/post/How_to_test_saturated_path_models_using_SEM1

Mikko

